### Pick an account id from the wallet first
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts?size=1

> {% client.global.set("account", response.body.content[0].id); %}

### Balance (state store: balances)
GET http://localhost:8082/balances/{{account}}

### Account summary (table-table join: accounts LEFT JOIN balances)
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{account}}/summary

### Account profile (cogroup of top-ups, P2P sent and merchant payments)
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{account}}/profile

### Largest transaction (reduce)
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{account}}/largest-transaction

### Same balance from a second instance (started with --server.port=8086); forwarded if it doesn't own the key
GET http://localhost:8086/balances/{{account}}

### Per-minute transaction counts for the last hour (window store)
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{account}}/activity

### Per-minute counts for an explicit range
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{account}}/activity?from=2026-11-19T08:00:00Z&to=2026-11-19T09:00:00Z

### Late records dropped by windowed aggregations
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/metrics/kafka.stream.task.dropped.records.total

### Last activity (store written by a Processor API processor)
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{account}}/last-activity

### Duplicate CDC rows dropped by the deduplication processor (custom metric)
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/metrics/kafka.stream.pesaflow.deduplication.duplicates.dropped.total
